<title>HONG KONG: KLTCB A$125 mln Eurobond group formed.</title>
<headline>KLTCB A$125 mln Eurobond group formed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four banks have joined as co-lead managers for Korea Long Term Credit Bank's one-year-and- one-day A$125 million Eurobond issue, lead manager HSBC Markets said.</p>
<p>The four are BZW Securities, Commonwealth Bank of Australia, CS First Boston and Hambros Bank.</p>
<p>The deal is now free to trade.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
